*                                                                       VARP0030
*              INITIALIZATION                                           VARP0031
*              CALLING SEQUENCE                                         VARP0032
*              TSX $INITAL,4                                            VARP0033
*              TSX N          NUMBER OF WORDS IN MANTISSA               VARP0034
*                             N NO GREATER THAN 10                      VARP0035
*                                                                       VARP0036
INITAL CLA*    1,4                                                      VARP0037
       STD     N                                                        VARP0038
       SUB     1DEC                                                     VARP0039
       STD     NM1                                                      VARP0040
       ADD     2DEC                                                     VARP0041
       STD     NP1                                                      VARP0042
