*              LOAD MQ REGISTER NEGATIVE                                VARP0095
*              CALLING SEQUENCE                                         VARP0096
*              TSX $LDQN,4                                              VARP0097
*              TSX A          NEGATIVE OF WORD TAKEN TO MQ              VARP0098
*                                                                       VARP0099
 LDQN  SXA     AXTB,1                                                   VARP0100
